<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύγ-η</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>grain-crop, corn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ τρύγην οἴσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Ap.</u>
					55
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theognost.
				<u>Can.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				167.24
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1003.59
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>vintage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AP
				11.203
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				2.40b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRyl.</u>
				157.18
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. ἀμπέλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					p.63
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐπὶ τρύγῃ</span>”
				<i>grape-gatherers,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταφυλοδρόμοι;</span>
			 cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυγητήρ.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dryness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				368
			</span></i>.</div>
